%U A397714 1,9,8,4,4,8,8,0,2,4,0,2
%N A397714 Decimal expansion of the unique real solution c > 1 of (c-1)*exp(2*c) = 2*(c+1).
%H A397714 David Reeb and Michael M. Wolf, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1109/TIT.2014.2387822">Tight bound on relative entropy by entropy difference</a>, IEEE Transactions on Information Theory 61 (2015), 1458-1473, Theorem 8 and Remark 9; <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1304.0036">arXiv preprint</a>, arXiv:1304.0036 [quant-ph], 2013-2015.
%F A397714 c = sqrt(1 + N(3)), where N(3) = max_{p_i>0, p_1+p_2+p_3=1} (Sum_{i=1..3} p_i*log(p_i)^2 - (Sum_{i=1..3} p_i*log(p_i))^2), with natural logarithms (Reeb and Wolf, Theorem 8 and Remark 9).
